          <td valign="top"> 
            <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3">
              <tr bgcolor="#6600FF"> 
                <td background="images/bgside-1.jpg" bgcolor="#000000"> 
                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3" bgcolor="#10131B">
                    <tr> 
                      <td width="68%" valign="middle"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><b><font color="#e1e1e1">&nbsp;<font color="gold">Sweet Sunday</font></font><font color="#999999"> <font color="#e1e1e1">- 
                        </font></font></b><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#e1e1e1">by 
                        Otslak</font></font></td>
                      <td width="32%" valign="middle"> 
                        <div align="right"><font size="1" color="#CCCCCC" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">10/14/2002 9:15:39 AM PST</font><font size="1" color="#999999" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </table>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr valign="top"> 
                <td colspan="2" bgcolor="#000000" height="26"> 
                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">
                    <tr> 
                      <td bgcolor="#000000" height="23"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><font color="#e1e1e1">Started a bit early in the day with clearing Plane of Growth.  < Black Crown> repeatidly attempted to train us during clearance, but kept dying.  I think there were more corpses of them than mobs in zone.  Anyways, we ended with ganking the slut yet another time for some nice loots.  Grats Milez on the piercer, grats Orcar on the fist, grats Sss on the snare weapon, and grats Kujjo on Nature's Melody (twinks soon).  In the pic below it looks as if Pasten was giving Tuna oral pleasure, however this has yet to be identified as truth.</P><P><center><img src=images/raids/october/tunare_101302.jpg></center></P><P>Afterwards we loaded up the bot clerics and headed to Ssra to take out Creator for some shit loots that won't be announced.</P><P><center><img src=images/raids/october/creator_101302.jpg></center></P><P>Anyways, was a pretty good night for us and we hope to see more in the future.</P><P>Late,<BR>Ots</font></font></td>
                    </tr>
                  </table>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
      <br>
      
      <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
        <tr> 
          <td valign="top"> 
            <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3">
              <tr bgcolor="#6600FF"> 
                <td background="images/bgside-1.jpg" bgcolor="#000000"> 
                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3" bgcolor="#10131B">
                    <tr> 
                      <td width="68%" valign="middle"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><b><font color="#e1e1e1">&nbsp;<font color="gold">High Priest first attempt . . .</font></font><font color="#999999"> <font color="#e1e1e1">- 
                        </font></font></b><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#e1e1e1">by 
                        Otslak</font></font></td>
                      <td width="32%" valign="middle"> 
                        <div align="right"><font size="1" color="#CCCCCC" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">9/30/2002 1:17:58 AM PST</font><font size="1" color="#999999" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </table>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr valign="top"> 
                <td colspan="2" bgcolor="#000000" height="26"> 
                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">
                    <tr> 
                      <td bgcolor="#000000" height="23"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><font color="#e1e1e1">We started off by killing Dain today and were about to charge him, however word was that the newts were gonna PK us.  We said aiight, f that and ported out to own them.  Every single newt died once or twice, but that's besides the point.  Don't threaten us, we don't take it lightly.  Grats people on Dain loot, don't know who it was, don't care.  Then onto Xerkizh the Creator, or however you spell his name, total ownge, no casualties, blah blah.  So we decided, HEY, let's try a more challenging mob for a change, and well we did just that.  We worked hard and stayed focused for quite some time and learned a lot about how to kill High Priest of Ssraeshza without going to safehouse, *grins*...</P><P><center><BR><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/hp.jpg"><BR></center></P><P>We actually got him near 50%, but I found this convenient shot.  Shows the leet strat on how to kill HP.  Just have a warrior tank and hope his / her melee is enough dps to kill before the clerics run out of mana.  Notice in the back, you can see an enchanter meleeing.  I'm telling you, these strats are unbelievable!</P><P>Signing off,<BR> -Ots</font></font></td>
                    </tr>
                  </table>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
      <br>
      
      <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
        <tr> 
          <td valign="top"> 
            <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3">
              <tr bgcolor="#6600FF"> 
                <td background="images/bgside-1.jpg" bgcolor="#000000"> 
                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3" bgcolor="#10131B">
                    <tr> 
                      <td width="68%" valign="middle"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><b><font color="#e1e1e1">&nbsp;<font color="gold">Tunare Dead, Again.</font></font><font color="#999999"> <font color="#e1e1e1">- 
                        </font></font></b><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#e1e1e1">by 
                        Grewrt</font></font></td>
                      <td width="32%" valign="middle"> 
                        <div align="right"><font size="1" color="#CCCCCC" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">9/22/2002 3:58:52 AM PST</font><font size="1" color="#999999" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </table>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr valign="top"> 
                <td colspan="2" bgcolor="#000000" height="26"> 
                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">
                    <tr> 
                      <td bgcolor="#000000" height="23"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><font color="#e1e1e1">Becoming a routine clearing Plane of Growth and giving this whore a beatdown :)</P><P><center><BR><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/tunare-sept22/corpse.jpg" alt="KEKE">  <a href="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/tunare-sept22/tunare-large.jpg"><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/tunare-sept22/tunare-small.jpg" alt="yay" border="0"></a><BR></center></P><P>Pretty using fight, kinda fun to watch though.  Anyhow..</P><P><center><BR><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/tunare-sept22/earing.jpg"><BR><b>Remedy</b></P><P><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/tunare-sept22/nature.jpg"><BR><b>Burnfactor</b></P><P><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/tunare-sept22/bard.jpg"><BR><b>Clammor</b></P><P><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/tunare-sept22/branch.jpg"><BR><b>Morgan</b><BR></center></P><P>Grats to the peeps who got stuff, check back soon for another update ^_~</font></font></td>
                    </tr>
                  </table>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
      <br>
      
      <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
        <tr> 
          <td valign="top"> 
            <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3">
              <tr bgcolor="#6600FF"> 
                <td background="images/bgside-1.jpg" bgcolor="#000000"> 
                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3" bgcolor="#10131B">
                    <tr> 
                      <td width="68%" valign="middle"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><b><font color="#e1e1e1">&nbsp;<font color="gold">Got Worms?</font></font><font color="#999999"> <font color="#e1e1e1">- 
                        </font></font></b><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#e1e1e1">by 
                        Grewrt</font></font></td>
                      <td width="32%" valign="middle"> 
                        <div align="right"><font size="1" color="#CCCCCC" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">9/20/2002 9:46:40 AM PST</font><font size="1" color="#999999" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></div>
                      </td>
                    </tr>
                  </table>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr valign="top"> 
                <td colspan="2" bgcolor="#000000" height="26"> 
                  <table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="5">
                    <tr> 
                      <td bgcolor="#000000" height="23"><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#000000"><font color="#e1e1e1">Well, headed over to The Deep to give our first go at the Burrower Beast ring..  I must say, for once atleast I had fun in an encounter that Verant designed :)  Well made ring, and a rush if you're playing a melee jumping from worm to worm on the waves to kill them in time, was a blast.  Anyhow, here's a picture of the corpse and loot (yes, prolly one of the worst positionings I've ever seen, but that's for another time :)</P><P><center><BR><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/burrower/burrower-loot.jpg" alt="Teh Loot">  <a href="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/burrower/burrower-large.jpg"><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/burrower/burrower-small.jpg" border=0 alt="KEKE"></a></P><P><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/burrower/shard.jpg" alt="shard"><BR><b>Bizanich</b></P><P><img src="http://www.eqvindictive.com/images/raids/burrower/ring-ore.jpg" alt="grats aow level encounter for...this!"><BR><b>Saelamdar</b><BR></center></P><P>Anyhow, other random stuff killed as well, some Temple of Veeshan, Itraer Vius, Dain Frostreaver, etc over the past two days.  Grats everyone who got something, and check back soon, you never know when I'll get the motivation to do another update.</font></font></td>
                    </tr>
                  </table>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </table>
